WEBVTT

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:13.740
Hm?

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:15.740
Celine, what is that?

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:21.120
Wait, did you take one of Lala's inventions from her room again?!

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:22.460
You can't use that!

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:25.710
That's my experimental friend summoning system!

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:29.250
Oh!

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:38.760
Ouch...

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:52.030
Yui!

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:01.370
It looks like it works!

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:03.960
It doesn't work!

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:29.270
<b>fushigi na yasuragi kanshou</b>

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:29.270
<b>不思議な安らぎ観賞</b>

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:29.270
<b>This strange feeling of peaceful enjoyment</b>

00:01:29.270 --> 00:01:31.860
<b>shibaraku kono mama</b>

00:01:29.270 --> 00:01:31.860
<b>しばらくこのまま</b>

00:01:29.270 --> 00:01:31.860
<b>Will continue for a while</b>

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:36.450
<b>rikai funou puroburemu bousou</b>

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:36.450
<b>理解不能プロブレム暴走</b>

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:36.450
<b>An impossible to solve problem runs wild</b>

00:01:37.570 --> 00:01:39.740
<b>genin wa?</b>

00:01:37.570 --> 00:01:39.740
<b>原因は？</b>

00:01:37.570 --> 00:01:39.740
<b>And the cause is?</b>

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:46.210
<b>kimi to iru to kudaranai oshie wasureru</b>

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:46.210
<b>君といるとくだらない教え忘れる</b>

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:46.210
<b>Whenever I'm with you, I forget all about these boring lessons</b>

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:54.010
<b>kono henka kara umaretahonshin ukeireyou</b>

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:54.010
<b>この変化から生まれた本心受け入れよう</b>

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:54.010
<b>I want you to accept the true feelings born from this change</b>

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:57.970
<b>harimegutta saisho no kokoro</b>

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:57.970
<b>張り巡った最初の心</b>

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:57.970
<b>I reeled in the first heart I could hook</b>

00:01:57.720 --> 00:02:01.430
<b>taguriyose sotto seebushita</b>

00:01:57.720 --> 00:02:01.430
<b>手繰り寄せそっとセーブした</b>

00:01:57.720 --> 00:02:01.430
<b>Carefully saving it</b>

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:06.060
<b>hyouteki ni fukuzatsu na mune no yami takushite</b>

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:06.060
<b>標的に複雑な胸の闇託して</b>

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:06.060
<b>I use the complicated darkness in my heart on my target</b>

00:02:05.810 --> 00:02:09.150
<b>Care me! Care me! Care me! Care me!</b>

00:02:05.810 --> 00:02:09.150
<b></b>

00:02:05.810 --> 00:02:09.150
<b></b>

00:02:09.270 --> 00:02:15.150
<b>naiteru kokoro atatamete yatto kizuita</b>

00:02:09.270 --> 00:02:15.150
<b>泣いてる心温めてやっと気づいた</b>

00:02:09.270 --> 00:02:15.150
<b>As I warmed the crying heart, I finally realised</b>

00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:23.990
<b>watashi no himitsu heiki wa nani yori mo tsuyoku katakumusunda</b>

00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:23.990
<b>私の秘密兵器はなによりも強く硬く結んだ</b>

00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:23.990
<b>That more than anything, my secret weapon is strongly, firmly bound</b>

00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:27.250
<b>kimi to no tsunagari</b>

00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:27.250
<b>君との繋がり</b>

00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:27.250
<b>With my connection to you</b>

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:39.300
<b>m 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 117 286 143 269 181 273 b 153 295 177 318 193 314 b 176 321 172 328 172 342 b 166 328 152 327 142 348 b 150 304 130 304 97 324  </b>

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:39.300
<b>m 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 117 286 143 269 181 273 b 153 295 177 318 193 314 b 176 321 172 328 172 342 b 166 328 152 327 142 348 b 150 304 130 304 97 324  </b>

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:39.300
<b>「New move</b>

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:39.300
<b>「New move</b>

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:39.300
<b>~Two of a Kind?~」</b>

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:39.300
<b>~Two of a Kind?~」</b>

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:41.930
What's with that?

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:48.140
It's been a while since you've appeared before me like this, hasn't it Master?

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:51.020
So how do you like Sainan?

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:53.270
I don't like it.

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:54.690
It's too quiet.

00:02:54.690 --> 00:02:55.650
Is that so?

00:02:56.110 --> 00:02:58.150
That dumpling is delicious, isn't it?

00:02:58.150 --> 00:03:00.400
I often eat that as well.

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:02.700
It looks like you're enjoying yourself.

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:04.160
Yeah! It's fun!

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:08.120
Then I guess that's okay.

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:09.160
Hm?

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:13.380
Is this a dog?

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:14.790
It's a cat, Master.

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:24.180
Ah... it left.

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:29.430
At least it's not boring.

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:32.690
I can take it easy for a while, right?

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:33.730
Of course.

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:35.020
I'll just enjoy myself here.

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:36.190
Cat ears!

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:39.740
Until Darkness manifests itself.

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:41.450
Hey, Master.

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:43.700
Will you please tell me?

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:47.950
What exactly is the "Darkness" inside Yami-oneechan?

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:51.960
I'll let you look forward to it.

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:53.920
Boo!

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:55.540
Don't get so irritated about it.

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:57.800
There's an order that must be followed.

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:01.050
Darkness is a dangerous power.

00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:04.550
So much so that if we make a mistake in the release,

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:08.680
we companions will also be swallowed up by it.

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:21.440
Yami-san!

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:47.220
Okay, I didn't forget to buy anything.

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:49.640
K-Kotegawa!

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:54.560
Ugh, this is awkward!

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:57.940
That happened just last night...

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:11.620
I can't believe that it summoned Kotegawa when she was in the middle of a bath...

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:16.290
Um... I'm sorry about yesterday-

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:19.170
Come over here.

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:23.760
I-Is Kotegawa...

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:26.680
Is she going to give me a close-quarters lecture...?

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:33.640
I'm doing this because it'll be a problem if you do something to them.

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:36.140
That bag is super cute!

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:37.730
This bag, right?

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:39.560
Oh, so that's what it was.

00:05:42.570 --> 00:05:44.280
Next stop is Dotabata.

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:46.030
Next stop, Dotabata.

00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:03.380
Being this close, and the silence...

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:04.960
This is awkward...

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:10.340
It was such a coincidence to meet here!

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:12.640
Did you have something to do in town?

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:16.270
Nothing in particular.

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:21.020
I just went to the office because my father asked me to bring something he forgot.

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:23.020
Office...?

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:24.360
Oh, that's right.

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:26.740
Your father's an attorney, right?

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:28.990
What about you, what were you doing? {this line rhymes lol "sou ie anata wa nan no you nano yo"}

00:06:28.990 --> 00:06:32.160
Well... I was asked to come by my father, too.

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:34.910
He sent me to buy supplies for his manga.

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:37.870
My old man always get obsessed with the little things,

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:40.420
so the work is always multiplying.

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:41.210
Ah.

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:44.210
This was really cute, so I bought it for Celine as a gift.

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:48.970
Ah, it's cute...

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:51.260
What is it?

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:53.800
N-Nothing!

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:56.180
Next stop is Komiai.

00:06:56.180 --> 00:06:57.730
Komiai.

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:04.520
It got crowded suddenly.

00:07:04.520 --> 00:07:08.740
Now that I think of it, there's a fireworks display in the next town over.

00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:18.370
It became crammed in here in the blink of an eye.

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:20.370
I can't even move.

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:25.210
Two more stations until we reach Sainan.

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:27.590
Please, hurry up and arrive!

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:28.130
Hm?

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:30.930
Kotegawa?

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:33.550
I feel like I'm being glared at.

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:38.520
This feeling in my right hand is...!

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:40.770
A butt?!

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:43.020
This is bad...

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:45.650
It's so tight in here I can't move my hand.

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:49.070
Kotegawa is really glaring at me!

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:54.450
The train shook and made me squeeze!

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:56.280
This is bad, she'll be mad for sure now!

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:58.080
She's going to make me kneel down on the platform!

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:01.160
Good grief, how could you do something like that on a train?!

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:07.590
Don't be so afraid.

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:12.880
You're shameless, but...

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:17.600
I do recognise that you're an honest person.

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:20.850
Kotegawa...

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:23.560
Even though it isn't on purpose,

00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:26.110
I'm always doing things that make her angry...

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:29.530
In response to those feelings...

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:33.360
I have to get my hand out, somehow.

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:34.070
Hey...

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:36.320
I told you, you don't have to try to force it.

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:42.200
I don't think he realises that it's touching my chest as well.

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:53.470
I-Inside my skirt...

00:08:54.760 --> 00:08:56.090
Something is...!

00:08:57.260 --> 00:08:59.220
S-Stop!

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:03.520
Don't push it any higher!

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:40.260
I can't...!

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:45.640
Sainan.

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:46.890
Sainan.

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:54.070
We finally got out.

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:55.570
Kotegawa, are you okay?

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:57.450
You're sweating a lot.

00:09:57.450 --> 00:09:58.530
Huh?

00:09:58.530 --> 00:09:59.320
Oh, no.

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:01.200
It's switched on.

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:03.830
Shameless!

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:05.330
Why?!

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:08.750
It's nothing to worry about.

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:10.670
Is that so?

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:11.750
Yeah, that's right!

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:17.130
No matter what that Nemesis person said, your heart is yours, Yami-san.

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:23.260
But... there are times when I don’t understand my own heart.

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:26.770
That's the same for everyone!

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:31.980
Now that I think of it, Kotegawa Yui said the same thing before.

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:34.610
I didn't know you had talked to Kotegawa-san.

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:35.780
It's kind of surprising.

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:43.700
You can talk to me about anything, too.

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:52.080
If there's something you're hesitant about, we might be
 able to figure out the right thing to do together, Yami-san.

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:55.250
I want you to depend on me.

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:56.800
We are friends, after all.

00:10:57.880 --> 00:10:58.970
Mikan.

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:01.970
But...

00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:03.680
No buts!

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:06.310
If you don't say yes, I won't treat you to taiyaki any more.

00:11:07.180 --> 00:11:08.100
Yes.

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:09.310
Good.

00:11:24.280 --> 00:11:30.290
I said that, but I wonder if I can really help Yami-san.

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:35.790
Huh?

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:37.210
Mikan-chan!

00:11:38.460 --> 00:11:39.670
Mea-san!

00:11:39.670 --> 00:11:41.050
This is an unexpected meeting.

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:43.180
I didn't think I'd see you here.

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:46.680
Are you buying food for dinner as well, Mea-san?

00:11:46.680 --> 00:11:47.930
Well, something like that.

00:11:48.310 --> 00:11:49.180
Look!

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:51.560
This is...

00:11:51.560 --> 00:11:53.440
She's just like Yami-san.

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:58.690
I-I think you should have a meal with a little more balance.

00:11:58.690 --> 00:12:00.400
Balance?

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:03.950
But I don't really understand Earth food very well.

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:09.450
If you'd like...

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:12.660
You could have dinner at my home.

00:12:12.660 --> 00:12:14.000
Really?

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:14.830
Yeah.

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:18.340
I'm sure Nana-san will be happy, as well.

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:21.720
Just so you know I won't be dumping in a lot of sugar, though.

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:23.260
If you're okay with that, then you can.

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:28.100
Dinner... invitation...

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:30.970
How wonderful!

00:12:30.970 --> 00:12:33.020
Ah... I see.

00:12:40.440 --> 00:12:42.650
This is pretty cute!

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:44.860
Look at this, Celine.

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:48.580
Meow!

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:49.700
Okay, here you go.

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:54.250
So why are you feeling down?

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:56.790
Kotegawa is so hard to understand...

00:12:56.790 --> 00:12:57.500
Hm?

00:12:59.210 --> 00:13:01.000
Celine, what is that?

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:03.470
Oh, how cute!

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:10.510
I was really surprised that you invited Mea for dinner.

00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:16.600
I don't really have a good image of Mea-san.

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:18.860
If I had to choose, I'd say I'm not good with her type.

00:13:20.020 --> 00:13:24.360
But since finding out that she's Yami-san's little sister,

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:28.240
I've been thinking I should put some
effort into understanding who she is.

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:33.500
I'm sorry... for not telling you about who Mea was and other things.

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:34.830
It's okay.

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:39.630
It's not as if you could tell me something that Yami-san had kept secret.

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:43.010
But, well... I will say this.

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:48.680
It was cheeky of you to hide something from me, even though you're only Rito.

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:56.140
The two of you look like a husband and wife.

00:13:56.140 --> 00:13:56.890
Momo?!

00:13:56.890 --> 00:13:59.440
W-Why are you saying something strange like that suddenly?!

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:00.020
Here!

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:02.190
Momo-san, you should help us prepare for dinner as well.

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:05.860
Are you sure it's okay for me to interrupt your time together?

00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:07.700
Mikan.

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:10.620
Mea said she wants to watch you cook.

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:14.200
I've heard your cooking is delicious so
I'm looking forward to it, Mikan-chan!

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:17.500
It's nothing that special, though.

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:21.460
Celine-chan, over here.

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:38.390
However, Lala-sama.

00:14:39.270 --> 00:14:42.400
It's unusual for you to have a bath before dinner.

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:44.400
Do you have plans?

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:45.780
Not really.

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:49.610
Nana and everyone are having fun with Mea-chan.

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:53.530
So I thought we should look after Celine-chan.

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:56.620
Lala-sama, you are so kind!

00:14:56.620 --> 00:14:59.040
Let's play a game after this, Celine-chan!

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:08.420
What is it?

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:14.930
Celine-chan!

00:15:14.930 --> 00:15:18.350
Lala-sama!

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:25.520
No!

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:29.150
What's going on?

00:15:32.070 --> 00:15:33.950
You're so good at this, Mikan-chan!

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:36.540
Well, I am doing it every day.

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:39.870
Nana-chan, do you cook with Mikan-chan?

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:42.420
I-I'm not really good with that, so...

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:43.460
Oh, Nana.

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:46.840
If you can't at least cook, you won't be able to be a good wife.

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:48.380
Isn't that right, Rito-san?

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:48.920
Eh?

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:50.590
Rito has nothing to do with it!

00:15:51.130 --> 00:15:53.050
Good grief...

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:55.800
Hey, Mikan-chan.

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:58.640
Can I try cutting vegetables, too?

00:15:58.640 --> 00:15:59.100
Eh?

00:15:59.100 --> 00:15:59.980
I guess it's okay.

00:16:00.310 --> 00:16:02.980
Do you think a girl who can't cook is bad, too?!

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:03.850
Eh?

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:05.440
All right!

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:07.270
Be careful, okay?

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:09.320
This is surprising.

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:11.490
So she has interest in things like this...

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:14.990
Oh, it cut!

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:17.620
You should do it a little softer.

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:19.290
Is that so?

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:20.450
Like this?

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:21.910
Yeah, that's right.

00:16:22.910 --> 00:16:25.500
Also, make your left hand like this.

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:26.670
Like this...?

00:16:26.670 --> 00:16:28.920
Yeah, yeah. Just like that.

00:16:42.810 --> 00:16:44.310
It kind of...

00:16:44.980 --> 00:16:46.520
Feels like that time.

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:49.520
It's getting cut!

00:16:49.520 --> 00:16:50.530
This is fun!

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:56.530
It's dangerous if you get too excited!

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:02.500
Hey, can I cut it my own way?

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:03.040
Huh?

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:06.370
It's supposed to be a secret, but...

00:17:06.370 --> 00:17:10.250
You've already heard about it right, Mikan-chan?

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:15.590
About my true identity.

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:17.340
Trans...!

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:19.600
Keep clear, okay?

00:17:23.430 --> 00:17:24.600
Amazing...

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:31.570
She really is Yami-san's little sister.

00:17:48.630 --> 00:17:49.920
Huh...?

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:51.800
Mea-san?!

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:03.310
Cutting is so wonderful!

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:09.850
Mea-san?!

00:18:09.850 --> 00:18:11.900
Did she flip some strange switch?!

00:18:17.610 --> 00:18:18.950
Mea-san, that's enough!

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:20.620
It's dangerous!

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:22.660
Rito!

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:24.740
Stay down, just like that!

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:26.580
Ah!

00:18:26.580 --> 00:18:27.330
Eh?

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:40.680
What are you pulling out, you beast?!

00:18:39.220 --> 00:18:41.300
Put them back on, you idiot!

00:18:40.680 --> 00:18:42.350
I'm sorry!

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:42.350
Rito-san...

00:18:43.220 --> 00:18:45.560
Geez, Celine-chan.

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:48.270
Nothing will come out of my breasts, yet.

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:50.230
Hey, Mea!

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:51.100
Calm down!

00:18:51.100 --> 00:18:52.560
Everyone!

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:55.820
Big sister is coming.

00:18:57.400 --> 00:18:58.320
Mea!

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:15.550
Are you making progress with dinner?

00:19:17.670 --> 00:19:19.420
Ah, Lala-senpai.

00:19:19.420 --> 00:19:23.350
Oh? Mea-chan is cutting vegetables.

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:24.180
Yeah.

00:19:24.510 --> 00:19:25.640
Huh...?

00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:27.640
What happened to everyone's clothes?

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:30.520
We had a little accident while preparing the food.

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:33.060
Shall I mend them for you, then?

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:40.150
Good grief...

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:42.070
The vegetables are chopped into tiny bits.

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:44.450
Don't be so reckless, Mea.

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:45.580
I'm sorry.

00:19:45.580 --> 00:19:48.330
My switch got flipped and I couldn't stop.

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:50.410
Good grief.

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:53.040
You're just like Nemesis in that way.

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:50.660
Why don't I train you?

