00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:15.860
You're amazing, Mikan-chan!

00:20:15.860 --> 00:20:17.110
Thanks.

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:21.820
I don't think I can get along with her, after all.

00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:42.300
