00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:44.630
It's so warm.

00:20:44.630 --> 00:20:46.010
Well, of course it is.

00:20:46.010 --> 00:20:47.680
That's because it's fresh.

00:20:47.680 --> 00:20:48.930
That's not what I meant.

00:20:48.930 --> 00:20:50.180
Hm?

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:55.770
Eating dinner with everyone feels so warm.

00:20:55.770 --> 00:20:57.810
I didn't know that.

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:00.530
That's right...

00:21:00.530 --> 00:21:03.490
Even though she looks like she's grown accustomed to life on Earth,

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:07.160
she's still just like how Yami-san used to be.

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:18.920
Thank you for inviting me to dinner, Mikan-chan!

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:21.000
It was really delicious!

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:22.670
I'll see you!

00:21:22.670 --> 00:21:24.550
Bye bye!

00:21:25.380 --> 00:21:26.680
See you tomorrow!

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:28.180
Yeah!

00:21:29.640 --> 00:21:31.970
Mikan, I'm sorry.

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:34.020
For Mea causing trouble.

00:21:34.020 --> 00:21:35.190
It's fine.

00:21:35.690 --> 00:21:38.190
If you like, you can invite her to dinner again.

00:21:38.190 --> 00:21:39.190
Really?

00:21:44.740 --> 00:21:48.990
I don't think I can get along with her the way I do with Yami-san, but...

00:21:50.700 --> 00:21:53.080
Just once in a while, it would be okay.

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:14.430
<b>niwasaki yureru hana ga tsun to senobi de kotaeru</b>

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:14.430
<b>庭先揺れる花がツンと背伸びで応える</b>

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:14.430
<b>The flower swaying in the garden answers by stretching up</b>

00:22:14.180 --> 00:22:20.060
<b>tsumasakidachi de asa ni ohayou no kisu</b>

00:22:14.180 --> 00:22:20.060
<b>つま先立ちで朝におはようのKiss</b>

00:22:14.180 --> 00:22:20.060
<b>To give a good morning kiss standing on tiptoes</b>

00:22:20.310 --> 00:22:22.980
<b>saa yukou</b>

00:22:20.310 --> 00:22:22.980
<b>さあ行こう</b>

00:22:20.310 --> 00:22:22.980
<b>Now let's go!</b>

00:22:22.730 --> 00:22:29.780
<b>fui ni tsumujikaze omowazu shagamikomu</b>

00:22:22.730 --> 00:22:29.780
<b>不意につむじ風思わずしゃがみ込む</b>

00:22:22.730 --> 00:22:29.780
<b>Caught off guard by the sudden whirlwind, I reflexively crouch down</b>

00:22:29.530 --> 00:22:42.090
<b>fuwari sukaato ni kakushita yowasatsuyoku haratte miseta</b>

00:22:29.530 --> 00:22:42.090
<b>ふわりスカートに隠した弱さ 強く払ってみせた</b>

00:22:29.530 --> 00:22:42.090
<b>I firmly brush off the weakness hidden inside my skirt</b>

00:22:42.960 --> 00:22:51.140
<b>fuzoroi de sainan na nichijou ni sakihokorou</b>

00:22:42.960 --> 00:22:51.140
<b>不揃いで災難な日常に咲き誇ろう</b>

00:22:42.960 --> 00:22:51.140
<b>Let's bloom to our fullest in this strange everyday life full of misfortune</b>

00:22:51.300 --> 00:22:59.310
<b>sunao ni sodatanai kara chanto mitenakucha</b>

00:22:51.300 --> 00:22:59.310
<b>素直に育たないからちゃんと見てなくちゃ</b>

00:22:51.300 --> 00:22:59.310
<b>I can't be honest, so you have to pay close attention</b>

00:22:59.060 --> 00:23:07.320
<b>tameratta ano omoi sotto tsuchi ni umetanda</b>

00:22:59.060 --> 00:23:07.320
<b>躊躇ったあの想いそっと土に埋めたんだ</b>

00:22:59.060 --> 00:23:07.320
<b>I carefully buried the memory of my hesitance in the soil</b>

00:23:07.070 --> 00:23:13.580
<b>A flower blooming in your heart</b>

00:23:13.320 --> 00:23:18.870
<b>sono hi o yume mite</b>

00:23:13.320 --> 00:23:18.870
<b>その日を夢見て</b>

00:23:13.320 --> 00:23:18.870
<b>I dream of that day</b>

